### PhishShield AI - Comprehensive API Testing File
### Use the "REST Client" extension in VS Code to click and run these directly.
### Be sure to run "Register" or "Login" first, then copy the generated `token` 
### into the `@token = ` variable below so authorized routes will work!

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@reportId = REPLACE_WITH_REPORT_ID_AFTER_SCAN
@simulationId = REPLACE_WITH_SIMULATION_ID_AFTER_START

=======================================================
================ 1. HEALTH AND UTILS ==================
=======================================================

### Check if server is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

=======================================================
================ 2. AUTHENTICATION ====================
=======================================================

### Register a New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jane Admin",
    "email": "jane88@phishshield.com",
    "password": "securepassword123"
}

###
### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "jane88@phishshield.com",
    "password": "securepassword123"
}

###
### Get Current User Profile (Requires @token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Generate a new Developer API Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/api-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Production Bot Key"
}


=======================================================
=================== 3. SCANNERS =======================
=======================================================

### Scan a Malicious URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/scan/url
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "url": "http://192.168.1.5/login.paypal.verify/banking-secure"
}

###
### Scan a Safe URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/scan/url
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "url": "https://www.google.com/search?q=puppies"
}

###
### Scan a Phishing Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/scan/message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "text": "URGENT ACTION REQUIRED: Dear customer, your bank account has been compromised! Log in immediately here: http://secure-update-acct.com to secure your funds before they are frozen forever! Do this now!"
}

###
### Scan a Screenshot (Image Upload)
### Note: Ensure you have an image named proxy.png in the same directory, or change the path below `< ./proxy.png`
POST {{baseUrl}}/scan/screenshot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="proxy.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./proxy.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


=======================================================
=============== 4. REPORTS & HISTORY ==================
=======================================================

### Get All Scan Reports (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Get Specific Report by ID (Requires replacing @reportId above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Export Reports to JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


=======================================================
==================== 5. DASHBOARD =====================
=======================================================

### Get Dashboard Key Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Get Dashboard Activity Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/feed?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Get Dashboard Analytics Charts Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/charts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


=======================================================
================= 6. SIMULATIONS ======================
=======================================================

### Get Available Phishing Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/simulation/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Start a New Simulation Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulation/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "templateId": "tpl_1"
}

###
### Track User Action (Failed: Clicked Link)
### Replace {{@simulationId}} at top using ID from the /start endpoint above
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulation/action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "simId": "{{simulationId}}",
    "actionType": "click_link"
}

###
### Track Another User Action (Failed: Entered Credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulation/action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "simId": "{{simulationId}}",
    "actionType": "enter_creds"
}

###
### Track User Action (Success: Reported Phishing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulation/action
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "simId": "{{simulationId}}",
    "actionType": "report"
}

###
### Get Final Simulation Report/Score
GET {{baseUrl}}/simulation/{{simulationId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
